# Privacy Policy

## Introduction

At **Rebricks Digital LLC**, we are committed to fair and transparent practices that protect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have.

We only collect the information necessary to operate our business and provide services to you. We never sell your data.

---

## Company Information

**Rebricks Digital LLC**  
Registered Address: 202 N Cedar Ave STE #1, Owatonna, MN 55060, USA  
Email: [hello@rebricksdigital.com](mailto:hello@rebricksdigital.com)

---

## Information We Collect

### Information You Provide

When you submit our contact form, we collect:
- Your name  
- Your email address  
- Your message  

This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry. Submissions are stored securely and may be sent to us by email.

---

### Analytics and Behavioral Data

We use **Microsoft Clarity** and **Microsoft Advertising** to understand how users interact with our website. This includes heatmaps, session replays, and behavioral data.

> _We partner with Microsoft Clarity to capture how you use and interact with our website through behavioral metrics, heatmaps, and session replay to improve and market our products/services. Website usage data is captured using first and third-party cookies and other tracking technologies to determine the popularity of products/services and online activity. Additionally, we use this information for site optimization, fraud/security purposes, and advertising. For more information about how Microsoft collects and uses your data, visit the [Microsoft Privacy Statement](https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement)._

---

## How We Use Your Information

We use your data for:
- Responding to contact form inquiries  
- Analyzing and improving the user experience on our website  
- Internal business operations  

We do **not** use your personal information for advertising or marketing without your explicit consent.

---

## Data Storage and Service Providers

We store and manage data with the help of the following providers:

- **Vercel** – Website hosting  
- **Microsoft Clarity** – User analytics  
- **Google Workspace** – Email and document storage  
- **Notion** – Internal project and client data management  

Access to client data is limited to team members with a need-to-know basis and is used solely for delivering services.

---

## Do We Use Cookies?

Yes, but only as part of the Microsoft Clarity integration, which uses cookies and other tracking technologies.

---

## Children

Our services are not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.

---

## Your Rights

Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:
- Access the data we store about you  
- Correct inaccurate information  
- Request deletion of your data  
- Object to data processing  
- Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority  

To exercise any of these rights, email us at [hello@rebricksdigital.com](mailto:hello@rebricksdigital.com).

---

## Legal Basis and Compliance

Rebricks Digital LLC is based in the United States and complies with applicable U.S. data privacy laws.

We currently operate under the principles of:
- **The California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)**, to the extent it applies  
- General best practices from **GDPR** for transparency and control

> **Note:** As a small business, we are likely not subject to the full scope of the CCPA unless we meet certain thresholds (e.g., $25M revenue, 50K+ users). However, we voluntarily adopt transparency practices aligned with CCPA principles.

---

## Data Security

We follow industry-standard practices to secure your information, including limited access, encryption (where applicable), and secure storage. However, no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

---

## Third-Party Links

Our website may link to third-party sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices or content. Please review their privacy policies before sharing your information.

---

## Updates to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The most current version will always be available on our website.

